8	//              the exit is non-zero, so the item parks with the list.
9	//   not-live — a liveness probe failed: print the requeue marker with
10	//              now + Retry-every and exit clean; the executor re-arms the item.
11	//   pass     — comment the evidence on the item and exit clean; the executor
12	//              closes it done.
13	//   fail     — reopen Original-issue with the evidence (the verification did its
14	//              job by finding the fault, which is now that issue's), link it from
15	//              the item, and exit clean.
